  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kougny Onions&apos; Producers Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The current project will enable Union members to improve yields through significantly better access..to water, training, and guidance from an agricultural technician, and continued access to improved..inputs. The project will also fund training in organizational management and improved financial..systems, and establish marketing linkages with additional onion buyers to enhance the cooperatives..financial sustainability and increase members incomes.</narrative>
  </description>
